{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pulls/50","id":4535898938,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUaKq7M8AAAABDlxTOg","html_url":"https://github.com/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pull/50","diff_url":"https://github.com/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pull/50.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pull/50.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/issues/50","number":50,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"M5.2: explicit local retrieval with durable jobs and exact historical sources","user":{"login":"kl3574","id":31810429,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODEwNDI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31810429?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574","html_url":"https://github.com/kl3574","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"用户可明确选择当前内容块、小节或教材的精确修订，建立本地索引并读取完整原文。未建立/过时索引返回明确状态；重建、取消和丢失回执恢复使用原命令，任务状态另行回读。历史原文、当前修订、未审来源与预算遗漏均明确显示。\n\n关联 #27；依赖未合并 PR #49，基线 `feat/M5.1-provider-consent`。迁移 `0011_local_retrieval.sql` 增加范围、完整代际、FTS 和命令账本，Content/Jobs 保持各自写入所有权。规范 PRODUCT_DESIGN.md 3.0.3，SHA-256 `a9ad5cd57913630ef5cdf4781ae5f9155d44c7a7d8169bfec8ae4811be6481c8`。\n\n验证代码 `3dd75f01966bb5dcf0b9ea0855e6b82ce335d814`：\n\n- 完整前端 346 测试 / 57 文件通过；lint、typecheck、build 通过。真实浏览器全套 88 测试通过（7.6 分钟），包含检索冷范围、实际重建任务、整块原文、无匹配、预算遗漏与历史范围。\n- 后端原 f9a307a 的 427 声明输入与此代码逐项相同：1663 Python 测试通过（2 条依赖弃用警告），Ruff/mypy 通过；430 输入独立 spec 检查通过。未声称在 3dd 重跑完整 Python。\n- 固定 30 块 / 42 条 gold，两轮实际服务查询各为 38 正向 macro Recall@5=1.0、4 无结果通过，216 输入相同；不外推一般检索/模型教学效果。\n- UI 与账本恢复、模式/私有答案过滤、失效代际、取消及原 ACK 的独立反例和修复均保留。\n\n证据：`progress/evidence/2026-09-15/M5.2-final-gates/acceptance.json`；相邻 `M5.2-retrieval-ui`、`M5.2-retrieval-ui-independent-review`、`M5.2-retrieval-interface`、`M5.2-retrieval-integrity` 和 `M5.2-retrieval-independent` 记录实际源码、日志与修复范围。\n\n限制：浏览器运行改写了一张只作输出的既有合成截图，783 全清单 `unchanged=false` 原记录保留；其余 782 文件未变，新旧图归档后只恢复该输出。早期 native02 的两图/一响应附件被 native03 输出目录错误覆盖，原源码/日志/回执保留，缺失附件不以后续截图替代。构建保留大 chunk 警告。\n\n分支已推送并回读精确提交；CI 按实际 HEAD 单独追踪，运行中不宣称完成。此变更不表示平台 Tutor/Agent、真实模型/搜索或整体 M5 验收。密钥、真实学习者资料不公开；不自动合并或关闭 Issue。\n","created_at":"2026-09-15T10:23:58Z","updated_at":"2026-09-15T10:31:43Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"b945694a2f871552cb82ca2e3df4f3dfdfe4b8bb","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pulls/50/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pulls/50/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/issues/50/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/statuses/3dd75f01966bb5dcf0b9ea0855e6b82ce335d814","head":{"label":"kl3574:feat/M5.2-local-retrieval","ref":"feat/M5.2-local-retrieval","sha":"3dd75f01966bb5dcf0b9ea0855e6b82ce335d814","user":{"login":"kl3574","id":31810429,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODEwNDI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31810429?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574","html_url":"https://github.com/kl3574","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl357